Subject: [PATCH] Theme about logins with Bento tokens

---
 .../components/aboutlogins/content/aboutLogins.html  |  1 +
 .../aboutlogins/content/aboutLoginsImportReport.html |  4 ++++
 browser/components/aboutlogins/content/common.css    | 12 ++++++++++++
 .../content/components/login-message-popup.css       |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/browser/components/aboutlogins/content/aboutLogins.html b/browser/components/aboutlogins/content/aboutLogins.html
